Package: com.legacyfixes.messenger
Name: LegacyFix: Messenger
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Makes old Facebook Messenger builds report a supported client version (FBAppVersion 447.0.0.43.106 / FBPlatformVersion 447.0.0) without editing the app bundle, suppresses forced-update alerts and provides the shared LegacyFixes engine.
Maintainer: LegacyFixes
Author: LegacyFixes
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 10.0)
